        },
        "languageCode": "en"
      }, {
        "text": {
          "text": [ "\u003cspeak\u003eThe technician can arrive anytime between \u003csay-as interpret-as=\"time\"\u003e$session.params.start_time_hours\u003c/say-as\u003e and \u003csay-as interpret-as=\"time\"\u003e$session.params.end_time_hours\u003c/say-as\u003e. And remember, an appointment scheduled from \u003csay-as interpret-as=\"time\"\u003e$session.params.start_time_hours\u003c/say-as\u003e to \u003csay-as interpret-as=\"time\"\u003e$session.params.end_time_hours\u003c/say-as\u003e can start even 5 minutes before \u003csay-as interpret-as=\"time\"\u003e$session.params.end_time_hours\u003c/say-as\u003e and finish later.\u003c/speak\u003e" ]
        },
        "languageCode": "en"
      }, {
